<!-- INTRO / HERO -->
<section class="section container reveal">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Hello there. I am...</p>
      <h1 class="hero__name">Jose Gaspar Marin</h1>
      <p class="hero__bio"><%= (settings && settings.bio) || 'Editable bio from the admin panel here!' %></p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.github.com/JoseG320">GitHub</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/resume">Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__photo">
      <!-- Replace this whole .placeholder div with: <img src="/img/portrait.jpg" alt="..."> -->
      <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">About</h2>
  <div class="about__grid">
    <div>
      <h3 class="about__lead">Nice to meet you.</h3>
      <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>I'm Jose Gaspar Marin.</p>
      <p>I was born and raised in New Haven, CT.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section id="projects" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">Projects</h2>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <h3 class="project__title">CS Library</h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a library cataloging system</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>One of the biggest and most challenging projects I have done so far is CS Library, a computer science capstone project.</p>
      <p>The only reason why it was</p>
      <p>Despite the difficulties the project team and I had, we pulled through and deployed a complete that will be maintained by the Computer Science Department.</p>
      <p></p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <h3 class="project__title">Sentinel</h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a zone-aware security system</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>Privacy and security is something I take extremely seriously. It is a fundamental right that we should all have, no matter the scope.</p>
      <p>This especially holds true with having privacy and security solution in your own home. The problem with that is how expensive and difficult those services and systems are to use.</p>
      <p>Thats when I came up with Sentinel. The solution to the problem.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__media">
      <div class="placeholder"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg></div>
      <h3 class="project__title">Echo</h3>
      <p class="project__desc">a music comparator app</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project__body">
      <p>I love music. Music is everything to me.</p>
      <p>Echo is the first project I have worked on with a database. Its a social media platform where users can add songs to their library, add songs to playlists, view songs by other people, and compare your music library with other users.</p>
      <p>I would love to expand on this product in the future, to make it a full fledged application.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<!-- CONTACT -->
<section id="contact" class="section container reveal">
  <h2 class="section__title">Contact</h2>
  <div class="contact__grid">
    <div>
      <h3 class="contact__lead">Let's work together.</h3>
      <div class="contact__text">
        <p>I'm always available to seek opportunities for work and would love to collaborate with you, whether that would be on a job or project.</p>
        <p>I'm always available </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="form" action="/contact" method="post">
      <% if (typeof csrfToken !== 'undefined') { %><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>" /><% } %>
      <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave blank<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required />
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required />
      <input type="text" name="subject" placeholder="Subject" />
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Message" required></textarea>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
